Error [jet.DuplicateSwitchOff]: Only one switch-off attribute can be written on a statement
  --> tests/ui/off_debug_doubled_attr.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     #Off #Off(.Release) print("never")
    |          ^^^^
 Why: Two `#Off` markers both control whether the same statement emits code
 Fix: Keep one marker: `#Off <statement>` or `#Off(.Release) <statement>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0344
